Switch to a different profile

Usage: vendo profile switch [OPTIONS] [profile]

Arguments:
  [profile]  

Options:
      --account <accountId>  Switch by account ID instead of profile name
      --profile <name>       Use a specific account profile
      --debug                Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help                 Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo profile switch
  $ vendo profile switch myprofile
  $ vendo profile switch --account <accountId>
